OL,2,EFeedback from a first-batch MEGA65     
OL,3,Eowner: disappointed                    
OL,5,CAntwort:  BFreudentaumel               
OL,6,CComments: B25                          
OL,7,F                                       
OL,8,F( )                                    
OL,10,FOK, so if the R6 board version would   
OL,11,Fhave been called Mega65DX or Mega66,   
OL,12,Fyou would have been fine with it? I    
OL,13,Fdon't understand it but of course you  
OL,14,Fare entitled to this opinion.          
OL,16,CErster Beitrag:                        
OL,18,GHi, I recently learned about the       
OL,19,GVIXEN-32 core, so I got my MEGA65 out  
OL,20,Gof its box to try it, excited to       
OL,21,Gfinally try something impressive on my 
OL,22,GMegs65. It doesn't work. After some    
OL,23,Gdigging, I understand why: the core    
