OL,0,         GFORUM64   GDo 19 Nov F00:00:08
OL,1,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,Gneeds the 64 MB SDRAM chip that only   
OL,4,Gexists on the newer R4/R6 mainboards.  
OL,5,GMy machine, from the first public      
OL,6,Gbatch, has an R3A board, which doesn't 
OL,7,Ghave it. The only way to run VIXEN-32  
OL,8,Gis to buy a new mainboard.well I       
OL,9,Gthought, no worries, they certainly    
OL,10,Gexist some upgrade program             
OL,12,GI asked Trenz whether any replacement  
OL,13,Gor trade-in offer existed for          
OL,14,Gearly-batch owners. Their answer: no   
OL,15,Gexchange program, no trade-in credit,  
OL,16,Gno discount. The R6 mainboard          
OL,17,G(TE0765-07-B) can be bought separately 
OL,18,G(about US$528 incl. VAT when I checked,
OL,19,Gout of stock at the time), and I can   
OL,20,Gkeep my old board. When I voiced my    
OL,21,Gdisappointment, I was simply pointed to
OL,22,Gthis forum, with none of my points     
OL,23,Gaddressed.                             
OL,24,D]FForum64.de RSS feed            (2/3) 
